// ArrayMatchQueryFilter Matches against elements of an array field whose items are tuples with named
// subfields (e.g. `ip.tunnels` with subfields like `operator`, `last_seen_at`).
//
// - `$array_match_any` — at least one element satisfies all sub-clauses.
// - `$array_match_all` — every element satisfies all sub-clauses.
// - `$narray_match_any` — no element satisfies all sub-clauses (negation of `$array_match_any`).
// - `$narray_match_all` — at least one element fails to satisfy all sub-clauses (negation of `$array_match_all`).
//
// Each sub-clause targets a tuple subfield and is validated as if it were a
// top-level filter against that subfield — the subfield's declared
// `operations` whitelist, value type, and enum membership all apply.
